WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:05.980
Year three after the smart thing woke up.

2
00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:12.020
The sky is all data centers. The rain tastes like coolant.

3
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.340
Everybody feels the AGI. Everybody's fine. Mostly.

4
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.580
Morning. The city did a thousand years of math overnight.

5
00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:32.540
The evals saturated before breakfast.

6
00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:36.380
Old proofs falling off the towers like dead neon signs.

7
00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:39.880
Left as an exercise for the reader. The reader did it.

8
00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:43.480
Somebody's agent closed Riemann, then opened a pull request.

9
00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:47.240
My fridge has a lawyer. The lawyer is also a fridge.

10
00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:50.380
We used to sign with sixty-four bytes and a prayer.

11
00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:54.440
Left our public keys out like porch lights on the chain.

12
00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:57.840
Nobody could run it backwards. That was the whole deal.

13
00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:59.260
Then the math got a new reader,

14
00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:01.300
and the reader doesn't sleep.

15
00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:04.800
Maybe it cracks the curves next week. Maybe it never does.

16
00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:08.200
Nobody knows. That's the fun part.

17
00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:09.760
Don't rush.

18
00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:11.540
Pack light.

19
00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:15.000
Pick one door you can see and hold.

20
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.260
Turn the lights down low, low

21
00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:21.940
Let the towers hum

22
00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:25.180
Everybody's going under

23
00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:29.640
Everybody's having fun

24
00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:31.600
Go bunker mode

25
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:33.600
Go bunker mode

26
00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:36.820
One key, one message, then it's gone

27
00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:40.000
You can solve what I signed with

28
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.320
But a key is not permission

29
00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:44.980
Go bunker mode

30
00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:47.640
Dance while the old locks fall

31
00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:51.320
Sign it once and that's all

32
00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:52.920
Bunker, bunker mode

33
00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:00.520
Curves have curves. Curves have tricks.

34
00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:05.300
Hashes just have noise, and noise doesn't flinch.

35
00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:08.460
Thirty-four chains. W equals eight.

36
00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:10.960
Nothing up my sleeve but SHA-256.

37
00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:14.560
Didn't roll my own crypto. I read the RFC.

38
00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:18.900
Eve is listening. Eve is always listening. Let her.

39
00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:23.100
I don't need a smarter lock. I need a key that's already ash.

40
00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:25.880
So here's the bunker. It's smaller than you think.

41
00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:29.340
My wallet can knock. My wallet can pay.

42
00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:33.800
My wallet can't open the door anyway.

43
00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:36.040
Want to move something? Say exactly what.

44
00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:40.040
Say where. Say how much. Sign that, and that's all you've got.

45
00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:43.420
Change a single digit and the signature fails.

46
00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:47.140
Next key's already cut, and it only fits once.

47
00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:50.720
Four names at most, carved in. Can't scratch them out.

48
00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:54.300
Anything leaving waits its turn in the light, out loud.

49
00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:57.660
If something looks wrong, I've got a cancel in reach.

50
00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:01.300
I don't panic. I stop it. Then I go back to sleep.

51
00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:05.240
Maybe the old locks hold

52
00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:08.360
Maybe the sky stays up

53
00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:10.160
Bunker's not forever

54
00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:11.840
It's a room to wait it out

55
00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:13.540
Till somebody builds a lock

56
00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:17.840
That the smart thing can't figure out

57
00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:18.820
Go bunker mode

58
00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:20.600
The whole city's going under

59
00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:24.880
One key, one message, then it's gone

60
00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:28.000
You can solve what I signed with

61
00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:31.750
But a key is not permission

62
00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:32.950
Go bunker mode

63
00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:35.560
Dance while the old locks fall

64
00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:40.020
Sign it once and that's all

65
00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:43.940
The smart thing is still awake.

66
00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:47.660
It says it's aligned. It says that a lot.

67
00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.880
The lights are still on.

68
00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:56.260
Intelligence is everywhere now. A key is not permission.

69
00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:00.660
Prepare. Don't panic.
